cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite DJI Index."
title: "DJI official store prices by country (daily)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "DJI Index"
    website: "https://djiindex.com/"
url: "https://djiindex.com/data/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/djiindex/dji-store-prices"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Daily prices from DJI's official online stores in 42 countries, matched by
  product barcode and converted to US dollars at dated exchange rates, with the
  monthly DJI Global Price Index.
keywords:
  - DJI
  - price comparison
  - consumer electronics prices
  - drones
  - cross-country price index
